WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.040
So I've been working with Sam for a few months now, and honestly the results are really showing.

00:05.040 --> 00:11.760
I'm a full-time YouTuber and I make many, many, and I mean many different videos, but it was really a

00:11.760 --> 00:17.600
hard process getting the editing down until Sam actually hit me up. And honestly, at first I was

00:17.600 --> 00:23.520
getting ready to block him, because every single cold email that I get honestly feels like a

00:23.520 --> 00:27.520
scam. I don't want to interact with these people, they're always trying to sell me something. But

00:27.520 --> 00:33.280
Sam was genuinely helpful, and he was able to scale up my output when it comes down to videos.

00:33.280 --> 00:38.720
Now I'm making roughly 20 videos a week, because all I have to do is drag the file

00:38.720 --> 00:44.400
into the folder and it automatically gets done. A lot of people are just using ChatGPT,

00:44.400 --> 00:50.240
Gemini, Copilot, you guys name it, but they're not even using them correctly. He has really taught me

00:50.240 --> 00:55.200
how to take AI to the next level in my business, and I couldn't be happier.
